mill-liberty-3.logic.r1: argue/scope: A4: read with the obligation on its consequent alone, first ∧ good_from_orig → O more_left, the argument holds; read with it on the whole conditional, O(first ∧ good_from_orig → more_left), C (S9) does not follow: it needs the ought on the consequent alone (narrow scope), not only on the conditional (wide), and which the sentence means decides the argument
